{"change_summary":"Reworked root-zone oxygenation into a single habitat-aware ROL path. The legacy binary `root_zone_o2_boost` was removed from habitat oxygen exposure, substrate penetration now uses a breakdown helper with base depth plus a saturating ROL bonus derived from substrate-active rooted biomass, rooted biomass is gated by habitat/substrate access, and tracing/budget diagnostics now expose base penetration, active rooted biomass, and the ROL bonus separately. I also updated the process-parameter docs/default config, added invariant coverage for `rol_rate_cm_per_g`, and expanded tests for zero-rate behavior, habitat-registry gating, growth/decline dynamics, denitrification directionality, nitrifier/nitrate divergence over 500 hours, and trace visibility.","outstanding_risks":["I did not run the full workspace test suite; validation was targeted to the substrate/root-zone, habitat-registry, and process-preset paths touched here.","The nitrification-side acceptance remains validated through higher nitrifier biomass and higher final nitrate over 500 hours rather than a dedicated substrate-local nitrification pool, because the current nitrogen-cycle model still uses global nitrifier guilds."],"steps":[{"description":"Inspect the existing substrate, habitat, and root-zone code/tests to identify the binary oxygenation path and the missing habitat-aware scaling points.","order":1,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Implement a single habitat-aware ROL penetration modifier, remove the legacy binary substrate oxygen bonus, and add explicit trace/budget diagnostics for base penetration and ROL contribution.","order":2,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Expand unit/integration coverage for zero `rol_rate_cm_per_g`, habitat-registry gating, biomass growth/decline behavior, denitrification directionality, nitrifier/nitrate divergence, and trace visibility, then run targeted validation.","order":3,"status":"completed"}],"validation_evidence":["`cargo test -p tank_core systems::substrate::tests -- --nocapture`","`cargo test -p tank_core --test root_zone_oxygenation -- --nocapture`","`cargo test -p tank_core --test habitat_registry -- --nocapture`","`cargo test -p tank_data test_backward_compatible_loading -- --nocapture`"]}